OL,3,AReform receives record #36m donation
OL,4,Afrom crypto billionaire
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK has received a #36m donation
OL,7,Ffrom a British cryptocurrency
OL,8,Fbillionaire - a record for a UK
OL,9,Fpolitical party.
OL,11,FWriting in the Daily Telegraph, Ben
OL,12,FDelo said he was making the move
OL,13,Fbecause he wanted a "fair fight and a
OL,14,Flevel playing field".
OL,16,FThe sum is the biggest single donation
OL,17,Fever given to a political party in the
OL,18,FUK.
OL,20,FParty leader Nigel Farage said he was
OL,21,F"honoured and humbled" by the gift.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
