OL,3,ATragic death of woman who testified
OL,4,Aagainst father in notorious mafia
OL,5,Amurder of mother
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman who testified against her own
OL,8,Ffather after her mother was murdered in
OL,9,Fa notorious mafia killing in Italy is
OL,10,Fbelieved to have taken her own life.
OL,12,FDenise Cosco was found critically
OL,13,Finjured on Sunday and died later in
OL,14,Fhospital in Rome.
OL,16,FHer mother Lea Garofalo, who was killed
OL,17,Fin 2009, became a powerful symbol of
OL,18,Fresistance to the mafia after turning
OL,19,Fwitness for the state against the
OL,20,F'Ndrangheta clan in southern Italy.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
